<v Ira Glass>[资助名单]

00:58:24.210 --> 00:58:29.600
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program by Mr. Torey Malatia, who's going to buy you a puppy--
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ节目管理由托雷·马拉蒂亚先生负责，他会给你买一只小狗——

00:58:29.600 --> 00:58:31.420
<v Emilio>And daddy will run over it with the truck.
<v Emilio>然后爸爸会用车把它压过去。

00:58:31.420 --> 00:58:55.920
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周回来，带着更多《美国生活》的故事。

00:58:55.920 --> 00:59:00.920
